        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Reporting in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Day... seven.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "More deceased got disposed of this morning. Likely extreme Originium particulate density in the building. Conditions for the Infected are turning south fast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "For the past 24 hours, haven't seen any workers in any area not covered by walls, let alone leaving the factory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Comms pick up heavy interference when I get even slightly closer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "High-voltage network all around outside. No way to locate the control room for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got the exterior patrol shifts and movement patterns down. Can't work out the guards inside yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to get this crap over with. If you give the go, I can take the most violent option.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... Fine, Rhodes Island does things its own way. Copy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Plan B? The factory's waste transporter goes down to the basement every morning at three. They stop running the sewer pipes in the meantime.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Simple enough to get through, as long as I get a gas mask.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm only responsible for paralyzing the security systems here, anyway. Not my job to provide followup support or guidance, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I know. I can do this less cleanly, if it comes to it. Figured that's why you called me for this in the first place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "End of report.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Insane how Rhodes Island actually wants to save Infected. What an employer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the sound of the transporter starting up... It's go time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
