        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Factory Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lights out, bozo.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Security system here seems almost as complex as a prison. Whatever, it practically is one anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Need to find the control room before I tip anyone off\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Any further and you'll trip the automated\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014What? You?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$tense_intro",
        "key": "$tense_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Tulio.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Scavenger'. Heh, didn't think you were still kicking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "What're you doing here? Guessing you've been dragging that weapon with you through the sewer pipes, huh, li'l rat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Hold on, lower your blade, let's talk this out. Else I'll sound the alarm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "The system's linked directly to police HQ. They're gonna read any signal from here as an Infected riot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You a guard here too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, but trust me, Scavenger\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch. Trust you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm betting we're after the same thing. I saw you knock that guy out. You're looking for a way out, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Cause I want out too, or else I wouldn't have stopped you just now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh* I'm serious, I turned a new leaf since all those years ago. Look, I'm Infected now too. I've been through hella shit, I... I understand you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've seen this factory up close. You know how things are here, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "They call me a guard, but I'm still just as much a prisoner as anyone else. We're all just as damned here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, but you're their overseer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know the sweet lies this place cooks up to lure in the Infected... I don't like it either, but we've all gotta get our hands dirty to survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't get any sympathy from me, sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on, I haven't gotten to the important part. I know the systems here inside out. You can't get past them without my help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "There're two watchhound cores monitoring the whole factory at the same time. Throwing the master breaker to cut the surveillance won't get you anywhere either; they'll switch to emergency power, fast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "You need someone to work with you, and obviously I need someone to help me out. So no matter how much you distrust me, working together's still our best bet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never said I was escaping.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you're wary of me, but\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014I'm completing shutting down this place's security system.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the job I took.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kinda merc just comes out and spills the job they're on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cut the crap. The sooner I'm done, the better. Tell me where the surveillance cores are located.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright... so you're agreeing to work together, then? Is that what you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what you're planning, Scavenger. I'm not gonna tell you every route straight away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Follow me, and keep to the foot of the wall. I've figured out the blind spots.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is the factory foreman in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's not. Why would he be? It's three in the morning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "He only shows up occasionally. What kinda healthy guy would wanna live in a place where the air's filled with Originium?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So everyone here's Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. Not a problem for you, right? You're already Infected, what's a couple more rocks gonna do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about the rest of your crew? I figure they all got their protection on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "What're you guys after, anyway? There's nothing valuable here, and we don't exactly make high-precision Originium products. Seriously can't figure out why anyone'd rob this place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Don't feel like answering, huh? You weren't this hard to talk to back when we used to do business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Although I guess you wouldn't have cut it as a merc if you were the same as before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't waste your breath. Never wanted to work with a piece of shit like you, anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we've got no choice for now. We have to split ways from here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Surveillance core's right over there, through the workshop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we each make our move in ten minutes. I'll find you after. Once we RDV, we head to the master control room and take out the whole system.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "You better have turned that new goddamn leaf.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
