    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I actually knew which side that coin would land on, the moment it fell.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Here, give me your hand. I'll teach you the trick. Like this\u2014",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "It's alright, Hamelin. You might be Infected now, but you don't have to stay that far from me.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "That's right, you'll be even further after today... You're leaving tomorrow morning, right?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I'm sorry. I couldn't do anything about it.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "We know you got infected so the community could survive, but they won't even let you off for it... I know, you had to take that risk so we could carry on. That's how it's always been.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Take this silver coin\u2014as a memento.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "No matter where you are, no matter what happens... I'm here, and I hope you live.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_prison_commandroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$suspenseful_intro",
        "key": "$suspenseful_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Base station signal screener's already off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Next, high-voltage network... down. Electric doors... open. Pulling the master breaker.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
