        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Asshole! Backstabbing me again?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "How the hell does this work out for you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194",
        "name2": "avg_149_scave_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. Always gotta try, y'know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194",
        "name2": "avg_149_scave_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Think you can get away with this? A little shit like you's never gonna fool me twice!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194",
        "name2": "avg_149_scave_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What else am I supposed to do? Just sit back and wait for you to take me out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Neither of us needs the other now. The factory doors are wide open. Of course I'm gonna make the first move instead of being the victim.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194",
        "name2": "avg_149_scave_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I never said I was gonna kill you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194",
        "name2": "avg_149_scave_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Duh. Why would you? But in what bizarro universe does this end with you letting me the hell go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm Infected too. Now I can understand how desperate you were back then... and also how much you must hate me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194",
        "name2": "avg_149_scave_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "True... never had that many clients I could put a face to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194",
        "name2": "avg_149_scave_1#1$1"
    },
