    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194",
        "name2": "avg_149_scave_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch. Since when did Zalaks have this much strength?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194",
        "name2": "avg_149_scave_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 3,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 10,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_149_scave_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 100,
        "fadetime": 0.9,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you, you're not getting away with this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now don't move, unless you wanna get cut in half.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's be clear. Whether or not I kill you right now is entirely up to my mood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... This goddamn Oripathy's making me so weak. How the hell are you still just fine?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "How did you pull this off? You're like a completely different person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. Of course you wish I was still that rookie merc. Pure. Gullible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "I did the dirty work no one else was willing to, and the client never gave a damn thing in return.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "I blacked out from an Oripathy attack, woke up in a ditch, and you know what I found? The few remaining things I had from home, gone, taken just like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were gonna die sooner or later, so I figured waste not, want not...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. 'Waste not, want not.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone living on the edge exploits each other like that. Isn't that the understanding?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what was I supposed to do? Wait for some Infected to die and cause a spreader event right in front of me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who knew you'd live? And still be alive today!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right... That's probably because I have someone who hopes I live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I woke up, I still had that silver coin sewn into my clothes. It was still there. That's why I decided to live on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really know how to hang onto life, rat. What could one silver buy you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never spent it. Never will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then how did you...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The same way you got tricked into this factory, thinking there'd be a stable enough life for an Infected here. But what you got instead were vile living conditions and inhumane treatment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I went through didn't stop there. Might've been even worse. But that's life for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hell are you saying to me...? Acting like we're in the same boat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're all in the same goddamn boat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*... Fine, I get it. Bet I look like the punchline of a joke to you now, huh? Must be nice, getting your revenge. No wonder you're in such a good mood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pssh... You think way too much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, and it's all your fault I'm in this mess anyway!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I hired your Infected mercenary ass, it didn't take long for me to get symptoms too. I should've just stayed away from you and your kind!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, get this through your skull. Touching the Infected isn't gonna give you Oripathy just like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think I'd believe that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No skin off my nose if you don't, but that's my current employer's view. I've gotta tell you on their behalf.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... Now I get why you wanted me to work with you, even though you were scared of me getting payback.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were gonna have me bust you out, then dispose of me to complete this imaginary 'revenge' of yours. Your whole 'waste not, want not.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha, like you weren't thinking the same thing? Weren't you biding your time with me, just so you could make your move now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "text": "So why're we still blabbering? Need me to teach you how they handle the Infected they kill here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. I only cooperated with you so I could finish my mission a little faster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can cope with shitawful work environments, and that includes shitawful coworkers. I don't think the way you do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, my mission was to aid and rescue the Infected, and you're one of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rescue the Infected? You're shitting me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever. Ask my employer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Reporting in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Factory security system paralyzed, but foreman not on site.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, I don't care how you guys extract the Infected. Maybe you're taking them somewhere or whatever. I just wanna confirm if my mission's complete or not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Factory guards are also Infected. You rescuing them too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "...So, I can handle problems my own way here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood. I'll withdraw to the designated site ASAP.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "End of report.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. Sounds like they're actually making good on what they said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never imagined I'd find such a trustworthy client. Let alone anyone who takes the Infected seriously.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Just like how her wish could never come true.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Anyway, you heard that. They gave me some leeway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_194"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn, you really don't care about anything except what your employer wants.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tulio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_149_scave_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Think what you like. I'll toss a coin to decide your fate, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it's tails, I clean up the trash here and now; if it's heads, I let you off, and give you one more chance to start over, like the other Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scavenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
