        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Scavenger slides out a tiny silver coin, and flings it into the air.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Many a time, alone with no one to turn to, she's shut her eyes and entrusted it all to the result of a coin toss.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Maybe one day, when you're not using every ounce of your strength just to survive, you'll get to decide where it is you want to go.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "She doesn't know whether a day like that comes for people like her.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "But this time, she knows what the coin will answer.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
